Google AI Agent Intensive — Project Exercise

This project implements an intelligent Image Generation Agent that interacts with publicly available MCP (Model Context Protocol) Image Generation servers. The agent is designed with a cost-aware workflow, ensuring safe and controlled use of bulk image generation.

🚀 Features
✔️ Smart Approval Logic

Single image request (1 image) → Auto-approve

Bulk request (>1 image) → Agent pauses → Asks for explicit user approval

✔️ MCP Server Integration

Connects to multiple publicly available image-generation MCP servers

Switches dynamically

Compares performance and stability

✔️ Kaggle-Friendly Agent

Fully runnable inside a Kaggle Notebook

Outputs images directly into /kaggle/working/

Easily exported and pushed to GitHub
